{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"57ee9ca1bb4fa40a3bbcf81f3f2f1ded504adde477f7532b8eb3015b78b14991"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:f91eed9860bd3b3e312290a84a3f9237980fc5af4372562f4380a868882a8443","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Volunteering at homeless shelter","evidence":"[D3:5 | 8:30 pm on 1 January, 2023] John: We held some events and got to meet some people. We went to a homeless shelter to give out food and supplies. Seeing the smiles on their faces, we knew we made a real difference. We also organized a toy drive for kids in need. It was amazing seeing the community come together to spread some joy.\n[D2:1 | 6:10 pm on 22 December, 2022] Maria: Hey John, been a few days since we chatted. In the meantime, I donated my old car to a homeless shelter I volunteer at yesterday. How's the campaign going? I'm keen to hearabout it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:a869e3fa-0e50-5f81-98b6-993979307310","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:4d6525cacba47ba95ee207eac92a97552dcd7aeeeff558dec47ce068f0bfa95a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What type of volunteering have John and Maria both done?","referenceAnswer":"Volunteering at a homeless shelter","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"4d6525cacba47ba95ee207eac92a97552dcd7aeeeff558dec47ce068f0bfa95a"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}